    {
      "@id": "#claim",
      "@type": "Claim",
      "name": "Entry 6: external DEMs (FABDEM/SRTM/COP30) and k_h for DEM-derived h₊/h₋",
      "text": "No single source is ground truth for ascent — they bracket it: the recorded baro under-reads (−11% raw / −21% smoothed vs the IGC 5 m DTM), the DSMs over-read (COP30 +18%, SRTM +34%), FABDEM lands +6%; nearest-neighbour sampling adds ~30 pp of staircase (use bilinear); the geometric k_DEM correction is the solid result, while the energy k_h (~0.8–0.9 estimated) stayed an open TODO.",
      "appearance": [
        {
          "@id": "https://github.com/danlessa/bicycling-energy-model/blob/main/research/journal/MODEL_COMPARISON_JOURNAL.md"
        }
      ],
